==Miscellaneous==
*Added 3 new [[User Rank]] rewards:
**26,200 grants +5 Special Catseyes.
**26,300 grants +5 Rare Catseyes.
**26,400 grants +5 Super Rare Catseyes.
*Added the [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event]] content from [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] [[Version 14.7 Update|Version 14.7]] to international versions.
*Added 1 new item used in the [[Nyanko Rangers (Event Gacha)|Nyanko Rangers]] gacha: '''Justice Hearts''' (伝説の正義の心, ''Densetsu no Seigi no Kokoro'')
*Added 1 new enemy type:
**'''[[:Category:Kaijin Enemies|Kaijin]]''' (怪人 ''Kaijin''): Exclusive to [[Anniversary/13th Year|13th Anniversary]] enemies. Like [[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus]], [[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]] and [[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sage]], Kaijin is not considered a trait, but always overlaps with a standard enemy type.
*[[Cat Combo]]s' buffs can now be limited to specific units rather than the entire lineup. With the exception of [[By Gun and Sword (Combo)|By Gun and Sword]], this limitation applies to all Combos added in the update, which only affect [[:Category:Nyanko Rangers|Nyanko Rangers]].
*Added 3 new Cat Combo types:
**'''Kaijin Slayer''' (怪人特効 ''Kaijin Tokkō''): Increases attack power against Kaijins by 2.5x and reduces damage taken from them to 0.4x. Does not have scaling sizes.
**'''Immune to Waves''' (波動ダメージ無効 ''Hadō Damēji Mukō''): Grants immunity to [[Wave Attack]]s. Does not have scaling sizes.
**'''Deploy Cost Down''' (生産コスト割引 ''Seisan Kosuto Waribiki''): Decreases unit costs by 5% at Sm, 10% at M, 15% at L and 20% at XL. Has scaling sizes, but is only available in XL.
*Added 1 new [[Talent Orbs|Ability Orb]] type:
**'''First Bounty Up''' (初回撃破時お金アップ, ''Shokai Gekihaji Okane Appu''): Every second unit deployed gains a set % of extra money from their first kill (applies to all enemies killed by an Area Attack, but not [[Wave Attack|Waves]], [[Surge Attack|Surges]] or [[Explosion]]s). Stacks additively with the Money Up ability. When two are equipped by the same unit, only one will take effect; the higher-Ranked Orb has priority.
*Raised [[Mr. Ninja (Special Cat)|Mr. Ninja]]'s + level cap from +20 to +25.
*Raised [[Coin Cat (Special Cat)|Coin Cat]]'s + level cap from +40 to +45.
*Raised [[Medal King (Special Cat)|Medal King]]'s + level cap from +10 to +15.
*Improved [[Zombie Outbreaks]]:
**The button that appears on the map when a Zombie Outbreak is available has been replaced by a timer showing how long until it disappears and which stage it is, just like the timer for [[The Aku Realms]] stages.
**The randomizer that determines which stage an Outbreak appears in will no longer choose a stage whose Outbreak has already been cleared. As a result, Outbreaks will always appear at the same rate, rather than becoming less frequent as they are cleared.
*Renamed [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Zamboney Cat]] to Cleanerbot Cat.
*Renamed [[Kaoluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Kaoluga Pasalan]] to Kaolan Pasalan.

